# Super Admin Role

Highest-level system administrator: global visibility and exclusive control over users, roles, permissions, system settings, integrations, payments, storage, security, and audit logs.

## Sidebar

Dashboard · Users · Roles & Permissions · Students · Instructors · Academic · Courses · Certificates · Finance · Research · Reports · Notifications · Support · System Settings · Integrations · Storage & Videos · Security · Audit Logs · Profile · Logout

## Dashboard

Platform-wide stats spanning users, academic queues, finance totals, and support. Charts + recent system activity. Super Admin is a control center, not stats-only.

## Exclusive controls

- Create/edit/delete users; assign roles; enable/disable; reset accounts
- RBAC: roles, module access, action permissions (enforced server-side)
- System settings, payment APIs, storage/video, email, security, audit logs
- Override academic/finance/research workflows when authorized

## Role boundary

Public registration → Student only. Instructor = promote Student after agreement. Finance uses payment settings but cannot modify them.
